  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Gilmanton, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Budget Resources   \t\t\t \n     Infrastructure  \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Boat Registration \r\n\t\t\t Dog Registration \r\n\t\t\t Fee Schedule \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t NH Fish and Game \r\n\t\t\t Real Estate Taxes \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Voting / Elections \r\n\t\t\t\t Election Results & Documents \r\n\t\t\t\t Town Meeting/Deliberative Session Minutes \r\n\t\t\t\t Voter Registration \r\n\t\t\t\t Supervisor of the Checklist \r\n\t\t\t\t Political Advertising RSA \r\n\t\t\t\t Useful Links \r\n\t\t\t Helpful Documents & Links \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nView Most Recent Minutes \nOverview \nThe Town Clerk / Tax Collector's office serves the needs of our residents and taxpayers of the Town of Gilmanton, in accordance with the laws of the State of New Hampshire. \nJustice of the Peace services are available if the Clerk is in office, weddings typically take 45 minutes. \nDue to RSA 456-B:2 VII, we cannot notarize wills, vital records, or copies of vital records. \nPlease make all checks payable to \"Town of Gilmanton\" \r\nFAQs \r\n             What are the Agricultural/Tractor/ Farm plate requirements? \r\n             Can I get an Antique title for my Antique Vehicle? \r\n             How do I change my mailing address on my tax bill? \r\n             Who do I make my check out to? \r\n             How do I change my name after marriage? \r\n             How do I become a resident of Gilmanton? \r\n             Taxes FAQ \r\n             How do I register a vehicle as an out of state resident? \r\n             How do I register my car in Gilmanton? \r\n             How do I get a certified copy of a birth, death, marriage or civil union certificate? \r\n             How do I obtain a marriage license? \r\n             How do I license my dog? \r\n             How do OHRV/ATV registrations work? \r\n             Information on property fraud \r\n             How many vehicles can I sell before I am considered to be a \"Retail Vehicle Dealer\"? \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\nAlerts \r\n\t\t\t\t\t There are no alerts at this time. \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tElise N. Smith, JP\r\nElected Town Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nEmail Elise Smith  \r\nPhone:  (603) 267-6726 Ext. 126 \r\nMore Information \r\n\t\t\t\t\tBrenda Holgate\r\nDeputy Town Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nEmail Brenda Holgate  \r\nPhone:  (603) 267-6726 Ext. 128 \r\nMore Information \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 503 Province Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Gilmanton ,  NH   03237 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t P.O. Box 550 \n\t\t\t\t\t Gilmanton ,  NH   03237 \r\nFax: (603) 267-6701 \r\nHours \nMonday through Thursday \n8:30 am to 5:00 pm \r\n\t\t\t Payments & Applications \r\n\t\t\t FAQs \r\n\t\t\t Stay Connected \r\n\t\t\t Tax Maps \r\n\t\t\t Job Opportunities \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\nTown of Gilmanton \r\n503 Province Road, P.O. Box 550 \r\nGilmanton, NH 03237 \r\n         Eversource Outages \n         Subscribe to E-News \n         Learn About \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n         Home \n         Contact Us & Office Hours \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
